{"data":{"Page":{"media":[{"id":185874,"idMal":60636,"title":{"romaji":"BLEACH: Sennen Kessen-hen - Kashin-tan","english":"BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War - The Calamity"},"coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx185874-aU3e6tBT6wwA.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx185874-aU3e6tBT6wwA.jpg"},"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185874-IdGyh1EBG91I.jpg","description":"Destruction looms at the end of the Thousand-Year Blood War between the Soul Reapers and Quincies… as the death of the Soul King mirrors the collapse of the Three Worlds, distortions and omens of destruction start to appear in all realms. \n<br><br>\nFierce battles erupt throughout the Wahr Welt between the Thirteen Court Guard Squads and the Royal Guard. Ichigo learns about Uryuu's true intentions and renews his determination to protect the world together, as friends who trust each other. Yhwach has surpassed even his own ability, The Almighty...\n<br><br>\nThe fierce battle for the survival of the Three Worlds approaches its end. Beyond the chaos of calamity, what lies in wait—despair or hope?\n<br><br>\n(Source: VIZ Media, edited)","format":"TV","status":"RELEASING","episodes":10,"duration":null,"averageScore":89,"popularity":91614,"favourites":3712,"genres":["Action","Adventure","Supernatural"],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"isAdult":false,"studios":{"nodes":[{"name":"PIERROT FILMS"}]},"trailer":{"id":"IJONbpfIlUg","site":"youtube"},"nextAiringEpisode":{"episode":9,"airingAt":1792418400}},{"id":180136,"idMal":59741,"title":{"romaji":"Tsuihou Sareta Tensei Juukishi wa Game Chishiki de Musou Suru","english":"The Exiled Heavy Knight Knows How to Game the System"},"coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx180136-gtMTCRlOD4OE.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx180136-gtMTCRlOD4OE.jpg"},"bannerImage":null,"description":"Born into a prestigious family of master swordsmen, Elymas Edvaughn’s future shatters when he awakens the so-called “defective” Heavy Knight class. Disowned and cast out, he regains memories of another life—and realizes this world mirrors a VR game he once mastered. Armed with knowledge no one else possesses, he sets out to rewrite his fate and prove the strength of the “weakest” class.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","format":"TV","status":"RELEASING","episodes":26,"duration":24,"averageScore":67,"popularity":67599,"favourites":1250,"genres":["Action","Fantasy"],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"isAdult":false,"studios":{"nodes":[{"name":"GoHands"}]},"trailer":{"id":"uC13b3_8riU","site":"youtube"},"nextAiringEpisode":{"episode":15,"airingAt":1791473160}},{"id":203490,"idMal":63061,"title":{"romaji":"Uchi no Otouto-domo ga Sumimasen","english":"Please Excuse My Younger Brothers"},"coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx203490-YQXiymUiDQNA.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx203490-YQXiymUiDQNA.jpg"},"bannerImage":null,"description":"The manga centers on high school student Ito Hazui. During her spring break at the end of her first year of high school, Ito's mother remarries, and Ito moves to live with her new family, becoming Ito Narita. Upon arriving at her new house, Ito is shocked to learn she now has four younger step-brothers. Ito tries her hardest to get along with all of the new members of her family, but the eldest brother Gen is a bit cold to her. However, under his aloof facade, he occasionally shows his kindness.\n<BR><BR>\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","status":"RELEASING","episodes":24,"duration":24,"averageScore":68,"popularity":11382,"favourites":169,"genres":["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"isAdult":false,"studios":{"nodes":[{"name":"Lay-duce"}]},"trailer"